@page "/components/alert-dialog"

<PageTitle>Alert Dialog — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Alert Dialog</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A dialog you cannot dismiss by clicking away, for a question that has to be answered. The same
    native <code>&lt;dialog&gt;</code> as <a href="/components/dialog">Dialog</a>, minus the light
    dismiss.
</p>

